CHAPTER.VERS:
Forasmuch as [there is] none like thee, O LORD; 

          He teaches the people to lift up their eyes to God, who has all power and therefore ought only to be feared: and in this he shows them not only the evil that they ought to hate: but the good which they ought to follow, (Rev_15:4).
         thou [art] great, and thy name [is] great in might.
